{"unit_id":"john-walks-slow__dsh-wait-subagent#card-zh","repo":"john-walks-slow/dsh-wait-subagent","commit":"909397ad4b09d89fe7b063be31812d985f8cefa7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-wait-subagent**（DSH 插件，任意客户端）：为后台 continuable 子代理提供主动等待能力。它在每个根 agent 上注册 `wait_subagent` 工具，等待指定子代理收尾后返回停止原因和收尾消息。主要功能包括等待运行中的子代理、识别已收尾的子代理、设置可选超时，以及响应调用方取消。适合需要在子代理完成后继续后续工作的 DSH 用户。使用前需要 Node.js 22.5 或更高版本，不需要 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:63-80","lib/index.js:118-201"]}
{"unit_id":"john-walks-slow__dsh-wait-subagent#card-en","repo":"john-walks-slow/dsh-wait-subagent","commit":"909397ad4b09d89fe7b063be31812d985f8cefa7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-wait-subagent** is a DSH plugin that adds `wait_subagent` to each root agent. It waits for a background child to finish and returns its stop reason and closing message. Optional timeout and cancellation are supported. Requires Node.js 22.5+.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:63-80","lib/index.js:118-201"]}
